{"id":"H2139","lemma":"זַכּוּר","transliteration":"zakkur","sayIt":"zak-KUR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zaccur","meaning":"A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Num.13.4;\nfather of: Shammua (H8051)\n§ Zaccur or Zacchur = \"mindful\"\n1) father of Shammua, the Reubenite spy\n2) a Simeonite of the family of Mishma\n3) a Merarite Levite, son of Jaaziah\n4) son of Asaph the singer\n5) the son of Imri who assisted Nehemiah in rebuilding the wall\n6) a Levite, or family of Levites, who signed the covenant with Nehemiah\n7) a Levite whose son or descendant Hanan was one of the treasurers over the treasuries appointed by Nehemiah","glosses":["zaccur"],"count":10,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-13","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zaccur","kjv":"Zacchur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zaccur","kjv":"and Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-25","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zaccur","kjv":"Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-25","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Zaccur","kjv":"to Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-8","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Zaccur","kjv":"and Zabbud"}},{"chapterId":"neh-3","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Zaccur","kjv":"Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"neh-10","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zaccur","kjv":"Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"neh-12","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Zaccur","kjv":"of Zaccur"}},{"chapterId":"neh-13","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Zaccur","kjv":"of Zaccur"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 13:4","note":"These were their names: Of the tribe of Reuben, Shammua the son of Zaccur.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:26","note":"The sons of Mishma: Hammuel his son, Zaccur his son, Shimei his son.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 8:14","note":"Of the sons of Bigvai, Uthai and Zabbud; and with them seventy males.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 3:2","note":"Next to him the men of Jericho built. Next to them Zaccur the son of Imri built.","source":"web"}],"rel